<title>UK: British industrial output falls 0.4 pct in August.</title>
<headline>British industrial output falls 0.4 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British industrial output fell 0.4 percent in August, official figures showed on Monday, a performance much worse than analysts had predicted.</p>
<p>Manufacturing production fell 0.3 percent in August. Year-on-year, industrial ouptut was unchanged and manufacturing output fell 0.9 percent on a seasonally adjusted basis.</p>
